.receipt-store/

# Timestamped .env backups. On 2026-08-12 a `.env.local.bak-<ts>` created while
# blanking a key was swept into a commit by `git add -A` and pushed, exposing
# every production credential. `.env*` alone did not catch it because the
# existing rule did not anticipate a suffix after the extension.
.env.local.bak-*
.env*.bak
.env.local.*
*.env.bak
